  unitName: Inferno Swords Logan
  unitId: 60285
  unitNumber: 560
  description: 'A twin sword wielding knight, transformed by the dark magician Shida.
    Discovering that the man inside the demonic armor he was after was indeed his
    long-lost friend, he let him escape. When he returned, he reluctantly allowed
    the magician to use a piece of the armor to transform him further, "in order
    to save his friend." When the gods invaded, the sight of him slaying one after
    another while clad in black armor proved one thing: his friend wasn''t the one
    who was cursed.'
  summonDesc: You summoned me,<br>knowing there's blood on my hands.<br>In that case,
    I'm all yours.
  fusionDesc: Each time I grow stronger,<br>I forget something.<br>Something dear
    to me.
  evoDesc: Nngh. My head...<br>What am I losing<br>in order to gain this strength?
  element: 6
  rarity: 5
